tools/langdata/sources/
tools/langdata/out/
spell-wasm/

# wordpipe open corpora (large, regenerable)
# NOTE the trailing /* : git cannot re-include a file whose PARENT DIRECTORY
# is excluded, so the negations below only work against the contents.
tools/wordpipe/sources/*
tools/wordpipe/out/
# ...except cmudict, which is NOT regenerable from anything in this repo and is
# an INPUT TO A GATE. tools/build_collisions.py computes the English collision
# table from it, and treats a missing cmudict as a failure on purpose. Ignoring
# it meant every fresh worktree lacked it, so the table could be regenerated at
# a third of its proper size and pushed: that happened in ebd6a673 (80 sets
# instead of 263) and shipped a day of learners being marked wrong for real
# homophones. Committed 2026-10-08 so the gate can run anywhere. BSD-style
# licence, (C) 1993-2015 Carnegie Mellon University, text beside the data.
!tools/wordpipe/sources/cmudict.dict
!tools/wordpipe/sources/cmudict.LICENSE
.claude/worktrees/
.corpus-cache/

# fastlane signing artifacts (get_certificates drops these in the repo root)
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest

# Swift package build artifacts (ios/ScanStack)
.build/

# SwiftPM build output for the NativeLanguageKit package. The PACKAGE is
# tracked (Package.swift + Sources); this is only its build cache, and it was
# committed by accident — 2,266 files and 197MB whose module caches embed
# absolute paths, which is how they turned up when the repo moved.
ios/NativeLanguageKit/.build/
content-pipeline/wordpic/.tone-probe/
contact-sheet/
tools/boardgame-golden/target/
tools/boardgame-golden/Cargo.lock
